            </note>
            <note corresp="#d432-f2" n="2" xml:id="d432-f2-content">
                <p>Not attached. Presumably reference is to telegrams 170451 to Jidda and Cairo,
                    170460 to Jidda, and 170459 to Cairo; see <ref target="#d433">Document
                    433</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d432-f3" n="3" xml:id="d432-f3-content">
                <p>
                    Saunders hand wrote the last sentence of
                    this paragraph. Handwritten notations on the memorandum read: “OK. WR” and “S/S
                    informed by phone April 7. BKS.”</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
